  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed `ExternalProcess` event handler leak — handlers are now properly unsubscribed before re-subscribing on `Start`/`StartAsync`\n- Fixed null-safe config conversion, double-dispose guard, and `ExitTime` UTC handling in `ExternalProcess`\n- Fixed `ProcessWrapper` error resilience for fast-exiting processes\n- Fixed `CancellationHelper` exit-skew window — expected exit time is now captured when the wait begins instead of being re-derived in exception handlers\n\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Moved `AddCliInvoke` DI registration into this package from `CliInvoke.Specializations`\n- Cleaned up stale `GlobalUsings.cs` entry\n- Cleaned up XML doc comments on `ExternalProcess`, `ProcessWrapper`, `ShellDetector`, and `ProcessResultValidator`",
